# Lessons — raw capture

One file per upgrade project (`YYYY-MM-<source>-to-<target>.md`). Append a lesson the
moment it is learned — terse, factual, with the evidence that proved it. This
directory is semi-durable scratch, not documentation: entries are ingested into
`references/sop.md` and the reference files at the next skill revision, then marked
`[ingested]`. Do not load this directory for normal skill use; read it only when
capturing a new lesson or revising the skill.

Entry format:

```
## <one-line lesson>
- status: new | ingested
- evidence: <what proved it>
- detail: <2-5 lines>
```
